      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6a3fcce2-bb48-40fc-ae97-66a799520f97",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "2de306ed-dbf7-4366-a11f-2e3a37467488",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The lantern shows\nSTEADY, and the\nwritten received\ncard is signed.",
                "The backup courier\nis named in the\nlog. Dot reads\nboth before",
                "declaring the\nsignal ready. Pip\nwaits for the\nwhole sentence,\nwhich",
                "she appreciates\nmore than he\nknows.",
                "The received\nlaunch card also\nconfirms the\nnormal service\nlimit is",
                "FOUR. The brief\ntest ceiling\nremains SIX; EIGHT\nremains a damage",
                "warning. Dot asks\nyou to carry that\nchecked value to\nthe final grid",
                "inspection, rather\nthan remembering\nthe largest number\non the old",
                "plate."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "65fb629a-2b09-486e-a54b-a5b5d2516e9c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7938546f-f4c6-4938-ae56-dd2b5a2f8e67",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The final\nrehearsal combines\ntwo problems: the\nlodge branch is",
                "isolated for\nrepair, and the\nrelay reply is\nunconfirmed. Other",
                "branches remain\nwithin the service\nbudget. The\narchive foot route\nis",
                "available for the\nmessage copy.\nSlush asks if the\nwhole launch must",
                "stop. Dot says the\nplan has separate\nresponses for\nseparate faults;",
                "the important\nquestion is\nwhether each is\nactually used, not\nwhether",
                "the city can\npretend the faults\nnever happened."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "781fc8a2-822f-4524-a2de-ffe6e7ddb09b",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "d9f09245-c79f-458e-a561-5f80b53e3b97",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Verify the correct\nnormal service\nsetting before the\nlaunch. A",
                "celebration does\nnot change the\nengineering\nrecord."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1754ca51-582b-4a58-a5ec-169b12f2ca5e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f9c39b5f-7bd8-4379-a0c1-e0c78e5d095c",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet fits the\nchecked regulator,\nsigns its launch\nrecord, and",
                "starts the\nturbine. The\nneedle rises to\nthe service mark\nand stays",
                "there. A branch\nvalve clicks, then\nanother. No one\ncheers until Dot",
                "confirms that the\nreadings agree."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "34aca5e3-4c67-469c-ac7d-1e7071fa95b5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "04d0da4a-8321-49ad-a1ef-f0e62336336f",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which combined\nresponse applies\nthe demonstrated\nsafeguards? HOLD",
                "means shut every\nbranch and wait\nfor a perfect\nsystem. PUSH means",
                "increase pressure\nand assume the\nmessage arrived.\nSERVE means keep",
                "clear branches at\nsafe service,\nretain lodge\nisolation, and\nsend the",
                "backup copy by the\navailable foot\nroute. Choose the\nplan you can",
                "explain to the\nwaiting residents."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2ff5a7f1-3a66-4dcc-af14-6ba5c6c7681e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "253cdfbe-85c6-4dbe-a1c0-b9d83b27f36a",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Pip reads his\nspeech: The city\nis warmer. We know\nwhy. We know what",
                "to check next.\nThank you for\ndoing your part.\nNib starts the",
                "applause. Slush\njoins with his\ngloves on, then\nremoves them so it",
                "sounds properly\nsincere."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
